ils possessing human corpses.</p>\n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"did-you-know\">\n    <h2>Did you know?</h2>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Fiends is also referenced as Fiend, devil fiends.</li><li>Power is a Blood Fiend.</li><li>Angel Devil is a fiend on Aki&#039;s squad.</li><li>Beam is a Shark Fiend.</li><li>Devil Hunters and Fiends appear together in mapped lore.</li><li>Evidence around Fiends is classified as fiction on Ton-o-Lore.</li>\n    </ul>\n</section>","overview":"<section class=\"overview\">\n    <h2>What is Fiends?</h2>\n    \n    <p>\n        Fiends are devils that inhabit dead human bodies, retaining devil powers while often displaying erratic personalities, as seen with <a href=\"/chainsaw-man/fiends/power\" class=\"entity-link\">Power</a> and other Public Safety assets.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p class=\"also-known-as\">\n        <strong>Also known as:</strong>\n        Fiend, devil fiends.\n    </p>\n\n</section>","word_count":389,"uniqueness_score":"0.6400"},"entity":{"id":"84e82f86-e4b1-434f-ac2b-d4158d150eb9","name":"Fiends","slug":"fiends","type":"concept","kind":"concept","type_label":"Concept","short_description":"Devils possessing human corpses.","description":"Fiends are devils that inhabit dead human bodies, retaining devil powers while often displaying erratic personalities, as seen with Power and other Public Safety assets.","evidence":"fiction","universe":"chainsaw-man","aliases":["Fiend","devil fiends"],"wikipedia_url":null,"image_url":null,"image_source":null,"image_credit":null,"image_license":null,"image_usage":null,"image_alt":null},"connections":[],"rabbit_holes":[],"copyright":{"theme":"chainsaw-man","title":"Chainsaw Man is not owned by Ton-o-Lore.","body":"Chainsaw Man, its characters, artwork, logos, and related intellectual property are the property of their respective rights holders, including Tatsuki Fujimoto, Shueisha, MAP